    "description": "Futures enables the Maintenance Group to identify, prioritize, and resolve mission-impacting deficiencies through disciplined innovation, continuous improvement, and risk-managed experimentation. Through a small, dedicated core that provides continuity and execution, and a squadron-linked network that drives initiative flow, coordination, and adoption, Futures accelerates the fielding of validated solutions across the group",
